#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Create the circuit {#1-create-the-circuit}"
msgstr "1. 회로 만들기 {#1-create-the-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we will create a shallow Clifford circuit with its entangling gates laid out in a brickwork connectivity. We will use this small circuit to visualize how checks are added to the circuit.\n"
